<title>USA: Coastal files shelf for $500 mln debt/stock.</title>
<headline>Coastal files shelf for $500 mln debt/stock.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coastal Corp filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $500 million in debt securities, common and preferred stock and common stock warrants.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Coastal will have up to $600 million in securities, the filing said.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay short-term borrowings and repay borrowings under revolving credit agreements.</p>
</text>
